  "skill": {
    "name": "why",
    "title": {
      "zh-CN": "why（pstack）",
      "zh-TW": "why（pstack）",
      "en": "why (pstack)"
    },
    "summary": {
      "zh-CN": "回答「X 为什么这样设计」「为什么选 Y」、设计依据、回归、事后复盘或有数据支撑的阈值；发现可用的 MCP 并并行查询各类证据（源码管理、工单、长文档、即时聊天、基础设施可观测性、错误追踪、产品分析仓库）。",
      "zh-TW": "回答「X 為什麼這樣設計」「為什麼選 Y」、設計依據、回歸、事後復盤或有資料支撐的閾值；發現可用的 MCP 並並行查詢各類證據（原始碼管理、工單、長文件、即時聊天、基礎設施可觀測性、錯誤追蹤、產品分析倉庫）。",
      "en": "Use for 'why does X work this way', 'why we picked Y', design rationale, regressions, postmortems, or data-backed thresholds. Discovers available MCPs and queries each evidence category (source control, issue tracker, long-form docs, real-time chat, infrastructure observability, error tracking, product analytics warehouse) in parallel, then returns a cited read on decisions and tradeoffs. Use how for runtime behavior."
    }
  },
